playing video games.

00:00:05.412 --> 00:00:06.245
- (laughs)

00:00:06.245 --> 00:00:08.871
- I know. You should maybe
give up video games now.

00:00:08.871 --> 00:00:10.510
- No, I don't think
so. I love video games.

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.543
- Yeah, a half century.

00:00:11.543 --> 00:00:12.809
Half century. And it's amazing.

00:00:12.809 --> 00:00:14.784
- And it's fun, it's a
nice checkout thing too.

00:00:14.784 --> 00:00:15.617
- (laughs)

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:16.540
- I like it. I play video games.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.010
