00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:19.913
Yeah, you just check out when you turn 50.

00:00:19.913 --> 00:00:20.780
Just give up Matt.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:21.613
- (laughs)

00:00:21.613 --> 00:00:22.460
- You're one foot in the grave.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.640
- No. I think it's so funny

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.310
