it's called Lifespan.

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:29.440
It's really good, you should check it out.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.070
but I think it's only as old as you feel.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.020
- Well, and that is something
I definitely embody.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:36.503
I, I, my inner child is very alive.

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.336
- Me too.

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:38.169
- I talk about ninjas for a living,

00:00:38.169 --> 00:00:39.170
I do stand up comedy,

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:40.260
I play video games.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.530
I, I'm 50 only on my driver's license.

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:44.510
- So, and Akbar did something
for you on your birthday,

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:46.560
now before we get his side of the story,

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.710
what's your side of the story?

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:49.230
- Okay, so it's my 50th Birthday.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.540
And you know, it's a great
cause for celebration.

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:53.340
So I, I, someone rings my doorbell,

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.430
and it's a delivery guy from Pizza Hut

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.510
and he says, we have 50 pizzas

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:59.020
for your 50th birthday.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:01.540
And I'm thinking, I can
maybe get through 32

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:02.373
- Oh my God.

00:01:02.373 --> 00:01:03.321
- Maybe, on my best day.

00:01:03.321 --> 00:01:04.154
- (indistinct)

00:01:04.154 --> 00:01:05.580
- But I'm like all right, you know what,

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.390
what a nice way for someone to honor me

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:09.060
by knowing I'm lactose-intolerant

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:10.298
and ordering me a ton of pizza.

00:01:10.298 --> 00:01:11.748
- I'm lactose intolerant too.

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:13.960
We're such nerds.

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:15.690
- I know. Pizza, no thanks

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:16.523
- Lactose intolerant

00:01:16.523 --> 00:01:17.820
- This isn't just for
me, it's for you too.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:18.700
- I'm trying to figure out,

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.950
what do you get a man
for his 50th birthday?

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:22.870
And I thought, you know, he's a comedian,

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:24.740
He'd, you know, so he could appreciate it

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:27.340
So, what I did is I was
calling A. Smith production.

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:28.730
I spoke to Anthony Storm.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:31.240
I said, find out where
Matt is going to be.

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:32.880
Those were our EP's.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.300
And I said, where's he going to be?

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:36.410
They told me what time
he's going to be home.

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:37.243
I got it.

00:01:37.243 --> 00:01:38.340
I ordered 50 pizza.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:39.400
I reached out to Pizza Hut.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:40.340
They hooked me up.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:43.220
So we got all the pizzas and I turn around

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.460
and I said, I need a makeup artist.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:47.370
So I called Megan Hester,
who does prosthetics.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.360
I get the makeup.

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.660
And I turn into, I put a big suit on,

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:51.630
get a whole big suit,

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:52.980
get a Afro wig.

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:53.920
I get the whole nine.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:55.830
- This Eddie Murphy (indistinct)

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:59.160
- I'm two hours into, into makeup just

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.930
to be able to pull off this stunt.

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:04.130
So I then pull up to
Matt's house and I said,

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:05.660
we're going to deliver the pizza.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.300
And my objective was, where I
had to turn into a little bit

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:09.133
of an actor.

00:02:09.133 --> 00:02:09.966
- What was my objective?

00:02:09.966 --> 00:02:11.960
My objective was, I'm hungry,

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.170
I want a slice of pizza

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.440
and I want to kick it
inside of Matt's house.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.850
And I just let the rest
kind of just flow with it.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:20.495
- I'm going to need to
see the tape of this.

00:02:20.495 --> 00:02:21.328
- Oh boy.

00:02:21.328 --> 00:02:22.620
- So, let's play the tape right now.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:51.087
- First of all, never take
food from Matt's plate.

00:02:52.265 --> 00:02:53.515
- Okay, okay so

00:02:54.508 --> 00:02:55.341
- Holy (beep)

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:56.670
- Okay so, let me say this.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:59.516
- You just like slammed the guy down

00:02:59.516 --> 00:03:01.378
like you didn't have pizza to spare

00:03:01.378 --> 00:03:02.434
- Hold on, hold on so,

00:03:02.434 --> 00:03:04.000
- Can we point it out, I just turned 50.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:04.860
And what did I do?

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.520
I took down an NFL player,

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:09.483
ladies and gentleman, if
the Broncos need somebody.

00:03:10.531 --> 00:03:11.364
- Oh my god.

00:03:11.364 --> 00:03:13.138
- No, no, stop, stop it Matt. Hold on,

00:03:13.138 --> 00:03:14.128
- Oh my god.

00:03:14.128 --> 00:03:15.004
- I'm embarrassing.

00:03:15.004 --> 00:03:17.870
- Okay. So I was telling
you that he's not athletic.

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:18.830
- 50 pizzas

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:20.987
and he wouldn't spare some.

00:03:20.987 --> 00:03:21.820
- Give me back that pizza.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:23.950
- I knew for sure that
he was not athletic.

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:25.410
And I knew, if you saw it

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:26.690
and you go back and look at the tape,

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:28.890
I put a Hakeem Olajuwon pivot on him.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:30.000
I was like, boom, bolt,

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.020
and then I turned around, spun,

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.110
and I was like, I'm outta here.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.070
I was going to run straight

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:35.280
into the house and something just clicked,

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:36.350
his eyes got big,

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.303
and he goes, No!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.890
And I'm like to be tackled by Matt,

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.340
it surprised me.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:42.173
He took me down,

00:03:42.173 --> 00:03:43.214
I felt it in my chest.

00:03:43.214 --> 00:03:44.400
- (laughs)

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.233
- Look at this, I mean,

00:03:45.233 --> 00:03:46.066
- He said.

00:03:46.066 --> 00:03:48.069
- No, you will not come into this house.

00:03:48.069 --> 00:03:49.980
- You said, you said happy birthday.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:52.120
He said, who is this.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.960
- He was like, you mother.

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:57.130
- Kelly, I go from this guy
and, in my neighborhood,

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.480
sometimes I've had people
break into my house

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.680
and this guy who is still 6'6,

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.250
- And running to go into your house.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.200
- Towards my house and I take him down.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.180
My heart is just pounding.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.571
I'm like, you stay down. Stay down!

00:04:07.571 --> 00:04:09.620
And then it's Akbar and I'm like,

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:10.780
I think I just got pranked,

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:13.960
and you just immediately
go to, oh, he got me.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.010
- I had everybody.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.370
I had the pizza man involved,

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:17.340
and I had (indistinct),

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:19.130
I mean Pizza Hut gave us the topper.

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.510
We had the warm bags.

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:22.250
We had the pizza, we had everything.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:23.900
So everything worked out.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:25.600
We had four camera guys.

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.560
It was great.

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.160
- That's, what a great friend.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.977
What a fun birthday. That's amazing.

00:04:29.977 --> 00:04:32.750
- Honestly, the best gift he
could have given me was footage

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.230
