on my 50th birthday.

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:37.860
- It's just such a strong
man. Taking him down.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:39.720
- You just show people,
like hey, this is me at 50.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.130
- Don't ask me to do it now.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.700
- Bet you're house won't
be broken into now.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:45.600
So that's all I'm saying, no
one's coming near your pizza.

